e decrypt path, mirroring the\nexisting AES-GCM branch. Add a regression test that asserts\nEVP_DecryptFinal_ex() rejects an all-zero forged tag.\n\nReported-by: Nicholas Carlini (Anthropic) & Bronson Yen (Calif.io)","tree":{"sha":"57c168d28bdec9c37e5de8f3a2ebec060a0aac30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/git/trees/57c168d28bdec9c37e5de8f3a2ebec060a0aac30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/git/commits/1faddd640edc8195c1fb7cb3904876e434ecab87","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commits/1faddd640edc8195c1fb7cb3904876e434ecab87","html_url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commit/1faddd640edc8195c1fb7cb3904876e434ecab87","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commits/1faddd640edc8195c1fb7cb3904876e434ecab87/comments","author":{"login":"Frauschi","id":5159151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTkxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5159151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi","html_url":"https://github.com/Frauschi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frauschi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"Frauschi","id":5159151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTkxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/